From ce4a41c253540742b6edc6b9936b7677fb022b62 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:38:50 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] bugfix: Preserve mailbox work across interrupted task starts

Red: just test -p codex-protocol -E test(inter_agent_communication_rejects_unknown_wake_policy) accepts an unsupported wake policy on the declared base.
Red: just test -p codex-core --lib -E test(background_subagent_interruption_before_registration_preserves_result_without_revival) loses ordinary queued mail and explicit follow-up context before registration.
Green: combined maintained core/protocol/app-server/features gate passes all 29 cases, including interruption before registration and unrelated pending-input preservation.

Scope: live-process best-effort delivery; no restart replay, task UI, or Monitor support.

Schema red: just test -p codex-app-server-protocol --lib -E test(stable_precomputed_exports_match_schema_fixtures) fails because RolloutLine.json omits the new mailbox policy.
Schema green: maintained just write-app-server-schema regenerates the stable precomputed export; the same focused check passes. Public API exports remain unchanged; internal schema adds only MailboxWakePolicy and InterAgentCommunication.wake_policy.
---
 .../app-server-exports-stable.json.zst        | Bin 155772 -> 155844 bytes
 codex-rs/core/src/session/input_queue.rs      |  86 ++++++-
 .../src/session/mailbox_retention_tests.rs    |  64 +++++
 codex-rs/core/src/state/turn.rs               |   3 +
 codex-rs/core/src/tasks/mailbox_wake_tests.rs | 242 ++++++++++++++++++
 codex-rs/core/src/tasks/mod.rs                |  91 ++++++-
 codex-rs/core/src/tasks/mod_tests.rs          |   3 +
 codex-rs/protocol/src/lib.rs                  |   2 +
 codex-rs/protocol/src/mailbox_wake.rs         |  19 ++
 codex-rs/protocol/src/mailbox_wake_tests.rs   |  45 ++++
 codex-rs/protocol/src/protocol.rs             |   9 +
 11 files changed, 550 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 codex-rs/core/src/session/mailbox_retention_tests.rs
 create mode 100644 codex-rs/core/src/tasks/mailbox_wake_tests.rs
 create mode 100644 codex-rs/protocol/src/mailbox_wake.rs
 create mode 100644 codex-rs/protocol/src/mailbox_wake_tests.rs

diff --git a/codex-rs/app-server-protocol/schema/precomputed/app-server-exports-stable.json.zst b/codex-rs/app-server-protocol/schema/precomputed/app-server-exports-stable.json.zst
